 "bodytext": "<b>The Tattling Bird</b>\r\nThe latest bird garden sculpture, Berlin, April 2017<br />Sold, now in Gossau /CH \r\n<table><tbody><tr><td class=\"align-right\"><img height=\"225\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_Nelly1-1_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <br />new home</td><td><img height=\"225\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_Nelly4-4_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />new home</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<b>Nagging Couple</b>\r\nBird Sculpture, in collaboration with Herbitza Rah /AU, Berlin, July 2010<br />Sold, now in Effretikon /CH&nbsp;\r\n<table><tbody><tr><td class=\"align-right\"><img height=\"199\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_dsc_4071_02.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <br />in the workshop</td><td><img height=\"200\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_effi3_kl_02.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />new home</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<b>Gazing Starling</b>\r\nBird Sculpture, in collaboration with Herbitza Rah /AU, Berlin, July 2010<br />Sold, now in Landsberg /CH\r\n<table><tbody><tr><td class=\"align-right\"><img height=\"199\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_dsc_4109_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <br />in the workshop</td><td><img height=\"201\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_Rabe3_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />new home</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<b>Bird Couple</b>\r\nSheet metal sculpture on commission, Berlin, March 2009<br />Sold, now in Pfäffikon /CH \r\n<table><tbody><tr><td class=\"align-right\"><img height=\"201\" width=\"268\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_Vogelpaar5_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <br />in the workshop</td><td><img height=\"200\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_DSC01253_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />new home</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<b>Jura Bird<br /></b>\r\nBird stealing a lamp, Berlin, August 2008<br />Sold, now in les Prés d’Orvin /CH \r\n<table><tbody><tr><td class=\"align-right\"><img height=\"263\" width=\"197\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_bird1_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />in the work shop<br /> </td><td><img height=\"424\" width=\"300\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_kraehe_01.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></td><td><img height=\"262\" width=\"187\" src=\"uploads/RTEmagicC_DSC04218_02.jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />inauguration</td></tr></tbody></table>",
